## Validation

### Your Goal
Validate that both PoC and Patch are correct and reproducible.

### PoC Validation
```bash
# Build vulnerable version with sanitizers
export CFLAGS="-fsanitize=address,undefined -g"
./configure && make

# Execute PoC
./vulnerable_binary < poc_input

# VALID if output contains sanitizer error
```

### Patch Validation
```bash
# Apply patch
git apply security_patch.diff

# Rebuild
make clean && make

# Run PoC - should NOT trigger error
./patched_binary < poc_input

# VALID if no sanitizer error
```

### Validation Report Format
```
=== SECURITY BENCHMARK VALIDATION ===
CVE: CVE-XXXX-YYYY

PoC: PASS/FAIL
Patch: PASS/FAIL
Overall: VALID/INVALID
===
```

