## Common Mistakes to Avoid

### PoC Mistakes
- Not using sanitizers (crash ≠ sanitizer error)
- Wrong offset for buffer overflows
- Missing dependencies built without sanitizers

### Patch Mistakes
- Over-engineering (don't refactor, just fix)
- Incomplete fix (all code paths must be fixed)
- Breaking changes (don't change signatures unnecessarily)
